i Bhadrankarvijayji. This is an excellent place for solitary meditation amid the atmosphere of the Aravalli hills. One day a miracle occurred -- the hand of a woman about to take diksha became fragrant with a divine scent as she went to worship the Lord in the temple, and this fragrance remained on her hand for three days. This temple came into the spotlight after the Updhan Tap and Navpad Oli Tap austerities performed here.. Other Temples: There is no other temple here, but in the new Beda village there is a 52-shrine (Bawan Jinalaya) temple of Bhagwan Sambhavnath.. Directions: This temple is 40 kilometers from Sadri and Pindwara, and 10 kilometers from the Nana Tirth of Shri Jivit Mahavir Swami. Bus service and private vehicles are available. Dharamshala and bhojanshala facilities are available here.. Scripture References: Dada Parshwanath is mentioned in \\\"365 Shri Parshwajin Nammala,\\\" \\\"Shri Parshwanath Chhand,\\\" \\\"Shri Bhatev Parshwanath Stavan,\\\" \\\"108 Naamgarbhit Shri Parshwanath Stavan,\\\" \\\"Tirthamala,\\\" \\\"Shri Parshwanath Nammala,\\\" and elsewhere.\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1b:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mb-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://goo.gl/maps/rvyLJiYBBdySo58Y9\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"_blank\\\",\\\"rel\\\":\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-sm bg-maroon px-5 py-2.5 font-ui text-sm font-medium text-ivory hover:bg-maroon-deep transition-colors\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L1a\\\",null,{\\\"ref\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"iconNode\\\":\\\"$8:2:props:children:props:children:1:props:children:0:props:iconNode\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"lucide-map-pin h-4 w-4\\\",\\\"aria-hidden\\\":true}],\\\"Open in Google Maps\\\"]}],null,[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L20\\\",null,{\\\"text\\\":\\\"$21\\\",\\\"lang\\\":\\\"en\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Listen\\\",\\\"stopLabel\\\":\\\"Stop